/*!
\page page_sthltdielectron StHltDiElectron

\brief HLT di-electron pair candidate selected online; built from two electron tracks with optional BTOF and BEMC matching.

\section overview Overview

`StHltDiElectron` represents an e⁺e⁻ (or e⁻e⁻) pair candidate selected online by the STAR HLT.
Di-electron pairs are a key signature for J/ψ, Υ, and thermal dilepton radiation. The HLT
identifies them by combining two tracks passing electron criteria (TPC dE/dx, BTOF β, BEMC energy).
All track and hit data are stored by value, making the object self-contained. As a
\ref StHltTriggerReasonCapable, it can be the trigger object in an \ref StHltTriggerReason record.

\section hierarchy Class Hierarchy

\code
TObject
└── StObject
    └── StHltTriggerReasonCapable
        └── StHltDiElectron
\endcode

\section datamembers Data Members

| Type | Name | Description |
|------|------|-------------|
| `float` | `mInvariantMass` | Di-electron invariant mass (GeV/c²) |
| `float` | `mPt` | Pair transverse momentum (GeV/c) |
| `float` | `mPsi` | Pair azimuthal angle (rad) |
| `float` | `mTanl` | Pair tan λ = pz/pT |
| `StHltTrack` | `mDaughter1PrimaryTrack` | Daughter 1 primary track (by value) |
| `StHltTrack` | `mDaughter1GlobalTrack` | Daughter 1 global track (by value) |
| `StHltBTofHit` | `mDaughter1BTofHit` | Daughter 1 BTOF hit (by value) |
| `StHltBEmcTowerHit` | `mDaughter1BEmcTowerHit` | Daughter 1 BEMC tower hit (by value) |
| `int` | `mDaughter1SelectionBit` | Daughter 1 selection bit flags |
| `float` | `mDaughter1Beta` | Daughter 1 velocity β |
| *(same)* | `mDaughter2...` | Identical set for daughter 2 |

\section keymethods Key Methods

| Signature | Description |
|-----------|-------------|
| `float invariantMass() const` | Pair invariant mass (GeV/c²) |
| `float pt() const` | Pair transverse momentum (GeV/c) |
| `float psi() const` | Pair azimuthal angle (rad) |
| `float tanl() const` | Pair tan λ |
| `const StHltTrack& daughter1primaryTrack() const` | Daughter 1 primary track |
| `const StHltTrack& daughter2primaryTrack() const` | Daughter 2 primary track |
| `const StHltBTofHit& daughter1bTofHit() const` | Daughter 1 BTOF hit |
| `const StHltBEmcTowerHit& daughter1bEmcTowerHit() const` | Daughter 1 BEMC hit |
| `int daughter1SelectionBit() const` | Daughter 1 selection bits |
| `int daughter2SelectionBit() const` | Daughter 2 selection bits |

\section example Usage Example

\code{.cpp}
for (size_t i = 0; i < hlt->diElectron().size(); ++i) {
    const StHltDiElectron* de = hlt->diElectron()[i];
    cout << "M=" << de->invariantMass() << " GeV/c2  pT=" << de->pt() << endl;
}
\endcode

\see StHltEvent
\see StHltTrack
\see StHltBTofHit
\see StHltBEmcTowerHit
\see StHltTriggerReasonCapable
\see StHltTriggerReason
*/
